    {
      "name": "Do You Know Who I Am?!",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> 1/day.</p>\n<p>The Chelaxian adjutant shouts at all present. The adjutant makes an Intimidation check and compares it to the Will DCs of all enemies within 30 feet. On a success, that foe is Frightened 1. A critical success does not grant an additional effect.</p>",
